              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "jennifer Van Ryckeghem"
            },
            "reviewBody": "First time making a greek salad. Followed the other reviews and added 2 TBSP of red wine vinegar and garlic - it was perfect, Thanks!",
            "datePublished": "2019-10-15T01:59:32.817Z"
